            "content": "Cool Books is committed to protecting your privacy. This policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your data.<title>1. Information We Collect</title>We may collect:- Email address (if provided)- Payment information (processed by third-party providers)- Usage data (pages viewed, time spent, etc.) We do not collect personal chats or messages, as no messaging exists on the platform.<title>2. How We Use Information</title>- To deliver purchased content- To process payments- To improve our services- To comply with legal obligations<title>3. Sharing of Information</title>We do not sell your data. We may share it with:- Payment processors- Analytics providers- Legal authorities if required<title>4. Data Security</title>We use reasonable measures to protect your data. However, no system is 100% secure.<title>5. Your Rights</title>Depending on your location, you may have rights to:- Access your data- Delete your data- Correct inaccurate data Contact us to make a request: admin@Cool Books.me<title>6. Cookies</title>We may use cookies to improve functionality and analyze usage.<title>7. Changes to This Policy</title>We may update this policy at any time. Continued use of the service means you accept the changes.<title>8. Contact</title>For privacy concerns, email: admin@coolbooks.app"
